      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>QUESTIONNAIRES ARE COMPLETED AND SIGNED BY MEMBERS OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AT AN ANNUAL MEETING. THESE QUESTIONNAIRES ARE RETURNED TO THE EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE FOR REVIEW. ANY CONFLICTS OF INTEREST ARE DISCUSSED WITH THE INDIVIDUAL MEMBER AND THAT MEMBER IS KEPT FROM VOTING ON ISSUES THAT RELATE TO HIS/HER CONFLICT OF INTEREST. ADDITIONALLY, THE ORGANIZATION COMPLETED DEVELOPMENT OF WHISTLEBLOWER AND DOCUMENT RETENTION AND DESTRUCTION POLICIES THAT WERE IMPLEMENTED IN EARLY 2009.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 15</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>SALARY SURVEYS ARE REVIEWED AND DISCUSSED AT A REGULARLY SCHEDULED MEETING AND SALARIES ARE APPROVED BY A MAJORITY VOTE OF THE EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
